WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:04.690
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
Agents of SHIELD made a huge callback to the

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.980
Howling Commandos and filled in all of Ward
and Garrett’s backstories.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:14.760
There was also a lot of foreshadowing for
people releasing secret power inside of them.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.660
Which means we could see some full on super
hero action in the finale next week.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.050
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do weekly videos for Marvel and Agents of

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.900
SHIELD, be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:31.070
When SHIELD goes off the air I’m going to
fill this spot with Star Wars videos.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:35.010
So let’s talk about some Howling Commandos
and Flashbacks.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.010
Careful for spoilers from the episode if you
haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.010
Here are my top 5 WTF moments.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.170
Number 5 - Garrett Recruits Ward For HYDRA.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:45.220
We finally found how Garrett ‘rescued’
Ward from that Bad Situation.

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:50.010
I actually thought he killed his brother in
that house fire but more importantly, I think

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.970
he convincingly lied about trying to kill
his brother.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:56.420
I don’t know why the SHIELD Agents had to
break into Juvie like they were breaking him

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.000
out of prison.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.440
Maybe Garrett was too lazy to spend the time
doing the necessary paperwork.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:06.340
The funniest part was when Garrett dumped
him in the middle of nowhere Wyoming and told

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:07.390
him to survive.

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:12.549
It reminded me of when How I Met Your Mother
showed Robin Scherbatsky’s Sweet 16 flashback.

00:01:12.549 --> 00:01:15.399
Played by Cobie Smulders AKA Maria Hill.

00:01:15.399 --> 00:01:19.709
She got dropped out of a helicopter and forced
to fight off packs of rabid wolves and horny

00:01:19.709 --> 00:01:20.810
miners.

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:24.779
Does that mean that Maria Hill is a bigger
badass than Ward?

00:01:24.779 --> 00:01:25.779
Pretty much.

00:01:25.779 --> 00:01:29.340
I know we saw his dog in the crosshairs at
the end.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:33.429
I think they want to leave the possibility
of Ward getting a redemption arc.

00:01:33.429 --> 00:01:37.279
If we had seen him straight up kill it, I
think that would be a much harder sell.

00:01:37.279 --> 00:01:40.829
And he didn’t even really kill Fitz and
Simmons.

00:01:40.829 --> 00:01:46.159
He just dropped them out of the sky in a glass
container, Loki Avengers Style.

00:01:46.159 --> 00:01:49.789
If only they had Thor’s Hammer to bust out
with.

00:01:49.789 --> 00:01:52.389
Number 4 - Howling Commando Antiques Roadshow

00:01:52.389 --> 00:01:59.419
This was definitely the most fun scene aside
from maybe them breaking into Cybertek.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:03.719
In case you forgot, Tripplett’s grandfather
was a Howling Commando and technically so

00:02:03.719 --> 00:02:07.320
was Nick Fury, but they’re playing it fast
and loose with the timelines.

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:10.280
Nick Fury was probably one in the 60s and
70s.

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.970
I wonder if he ever fought with Triplett’s
grandfather?

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:19.780
Here’s the items I heard Coulson geeking
out over: A hand held hypno beam, a transistorized

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:26.170
blaster gun, the joy buzzer EMP and the grapling
gun that they used to zip line onto the train

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:29.750
in the first Captain America movie.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:34.150
Just based on that I’d bet Tripplett’s
grandfather was on the team around the same

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:35.870
time.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:40.590
Don’t be surprised if we get more references
to Coulson’s love of memorabilia.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:47.159
I can totally see him playfighting with action
figures when no one else is around.

00:02:47.159 --> 00:02:48.380
Pew Pew.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:52.140
That’s actually one big flashback we haven’t
seen yet.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:56.079
A Coulson flashback to when Nick Fury first
took him under his wing.

00:02:56.079 --> 00:02:59.230
Number 3 - Garrett was the first Deathlok

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:03.049
In case you didn’t know the comic book version
of the character is a cyborg.

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:08.290
Not a Deathlok cyborg like on the show, but
we got a peek at his metal plating last week.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:12.099
He’s basically on the edge of death, just
because his body was so far gone when he first

00:03:12.099 --> 00:03:13.499
started the program.

00:03:13.499 --> 00:03:18.430
This was the big plan reveal, Coulson kind
of figured it out with his chart porn but

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.909
Garrett explains it explicitly.

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:22.170
He needs the serum to live.

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:24.079
He’s only got 1 to 2 months to live.

00:03:24.079 --> 00:03:27.391
I was so happy that they gave us that Garrett
flashback where he explains how and why he

00:03:27.391 --> 00:03:28.659
joined HYDRA.

00:03:28.659 --> 00:03:31.239
SHIELD basically took a dump on him after
an operation went sideways and now he’s

00:03:31.239 --> 00:03:32.359
out to make them pay.

00:03:32.359 --> 00:03:36.650
I keep watching Raina more and more closely
too, because as she learns what Garrett is

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:42.670
really after she and Ward start to distance
themselves from him.

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:47.670
I sense a reckoning, if it weren’t already
plainly obvious that Coulson always wins in

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:51.030
the end.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:57.079
Number X - Raina and May Foreshadow Transformations
and Releasing Inner Power

00:03:57.079 --> 00:04:01.969
This is all about Skye, everyone is wondering
WTF is up with her DNA.

00:04:01.969 --> 00:04:04.580
Raina is coming at it from a metahuman perspective.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:08.790
All that talk about “what’s on the inside
revealing itself” is just a clear indicator

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:13.739
that Skye and Raina are going to morph into
alien or superhuman form during the finale.

00:04:13.739 --> 00:04:25.069
I’m going to stick with my two possibilities
for Skye, either she’s straight up Frost

00:04:25.069 --> 00:04:35.199
Giant, like the monsters Raina mentioned or
she’s Kree.

00:04:35.199 --> 00:04:36.919
Either way both her parents were aliens.

00:04:36.919 --> 00:04:41.531
So she isn’t half anything, she is 100%
Kree or Skrull or Frost Giant.

00:04:41.531 --> 00:04:45.810
I think it would be badass if she were a Skrull,
it would explain the human form.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:47.060
Actually let’s go with that.

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:48.730
You’re friendly neighborhood Skrull.

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:52.380
and my Number 1 WTF Moment - Garrett Takes
The Serum

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:55.310
Glowy skin equals not good for Team Coulson.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.380
We saw him punch Coulson across the room in
the teaser for next week.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:01.400
So I’m guessing that he’s just healed
and super strong.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.740
And super crazy.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:08.310
I expected him to manifest some physical deformity,
but the minute Raina produced that vial I

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:12.270
knew there was no way Garrett was NOT going
to take it himself.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:14.710
That’s all he cares about himself.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:20.949
And why would she give it to him if she’s
pissed he’s such a deusche?

00:05:20.949 --> 00:05:23.680
She’s curious and wants to see what comes
out.

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:25.570
Just like with Skye.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:28.880
She kept looking at her own hand like she
was hiding something special inside herself

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:29.880
too.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:33.120
Like she’s either a metahuman or she’s
an alien or skrull in disguise.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:39.509
I full expect the finale to reveal but not
explain what Skye is.

00:05:39.509 --> 00:05:45.360
They’ll probably save the deeper exploration
of her heritage for season 2 and beyond.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:50.169
That feels like a Willow Buffy thing, where
she developed her powers over the course of

00:05:50.169 --> 00:05:51.169
a few seasons.

00:05:51.169 --> 00:05:52.379
Not all at once.

00:05:52.379 --> 00:05:56.210
But let me know what your biggest WTF moment
was?

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:59.940
And do you think Ward killed buddy the dog?

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:00.940
I don’t think he did.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:01.940
We never heard that rifle go off.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:04.490
Overall the episode was back to A minus status.

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:09.130
I loved Maria Hill last week, but this episode
really went a long way to deepening this Skye

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.130
Blue Alien plot.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.639
And right now, that’s really the only one
I care about.

00:06:12.639 --> 00:06:16.650
I totally expect Brett Dalton to be on the
show in season 2 and even if everyone hates

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:20.659
him, he’ll be back on Team Coulson.

00:06:20.659 --> 00:06:26.680
Bill Paxton has been a lot of fun to watch
at times, but I feel like for him, this episode

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:31.800
was just purgatory before he gets to be a
full on supervillain in the finale.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:36.169
He was amazing as a dirtbag SHIELD Agent and
then an asshole HYDRA Agent.

00:06:36.169 --> 00:06:41.300
But this episode was mostly him hobbling around
being taken out by joy buzzer EMPs.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:45.169
He was literally a fleshbag of fail until
he took the serum.

00:06:45.169 --> 00:06:47.630
I always hate those times when characters
are in limbo states.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.340
Either be a man or be a superman.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.740
Don’t sit on the fence.

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:52.220
It’s boring.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:57.371
Based on all the blue alien, May bottled rage,
Ward and Raina turncoat foreshadowing I feel

00:06:57.371 --> 00:07:01.860
like the final battle will be pretty much
all the main characters versus Garrett.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:06.020
Deathlok too, but they’ll have to fix the
detonator in his brain before he can help

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:07.020
them.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:11.240
I will say SHIELD has definitely gotten really
good the second half of this season.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.550
I really hope they’re able to build the
momentum for a strong second season.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.979
I know a lot of you have been asking me whether
or not it’s been renewed.

00:07:17.979 --> 00:07:20.870
Essentially yes it has, but not officially.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:28.259
They will make the official announcement when
they reveal the Agent Carter series.

00:07:28.259 --> 00:07:36.580
Right now in Hollywood all the studios are
announcing which shows are getting renewed

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:38.289
and which pilots are going to series.

00:07:38.289 --> 00:07:41.740
For instance, the Flash tv show at the CW.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:45.810
We’ll also officially find out about that
in the next week.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:49.819
So if there’s anything big I left out of
the video, just write it below in the comments.

00:07:49.819 --> 00:07:52.389
And let me know what you think Skye is.

00:07:52.389 --> 00:07:53.389
Remember, whatever she is.

00:07:53.389 --> 00:07:54.389
She is 100 percent alien.

00:07:54.389 --> 00:07:55.389
So you have to account for the fact she can
still look human.

00:07:55.389 --> 00:07:57.590
Hint Hint, Super Skrull.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:00.260
Next week is the finale, so be sure to subscribe
to get my video.

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:07.580
Remember, in two weeks I’ll start doing
regular Star Wars tuesday videos too.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:13.080
Right now click here for my breakdown of the
new Gotham Trailer and click here for last

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:14.370
week’s episode of SHIELD.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:16.010
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:16.350
High Fives!

